UBERON:0034713 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "cranial neuron projection bundle" ;
    IAO:0000115 "Any of the cranial nerves, or their central nervous system analogs (the optic tract, the epiphyseal tract). These analogs are not true nerves, and are instead evaginated sensory afferents emanating from the brain." ;
