    dcterms:description "The Front-Mu Point of the Liver meridian. Front-Mu points are those points on the chest and abdomen where the qi of the respective zang-fu organs is infused and converged. Located close to their corresponding zang-fu organs, the Front-Mu points play a significant role in the diagnosis and treatment of the disorders of the internal organs." ;
