        "sudden loss of voice" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the anteromedial aspect of the forearm, radial to the flexor carpi ulnaris tendon, 1 B-cun proximal to the palmar wrist crease.
 - Note 1: 1 B-cun proximal to HT 7. HT 4 is located at the level with the root of the head of the ulna, HT 5, the body of the head of the ulna and HT 6, the base of the head of the ulna.
