        "toothache" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the face, in the depression between the intertragic notch and the condylar process of the mandible.
 - Note: When the mouth is opened, GB 2 is located in the depression anterior to the intertragic notch.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.7 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
