        "hiccup",
        "indigestion",
        "insomnia",
        "mania",
        "mastitis",
        "vomiting" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the anterior aspect of the leg, on the line connecting ST 35 with ST 41, 3 B-cun inferior to ST 35.
 - Note: ST 36 is located on the tibialis anterior muscle.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
