        "muscular atrophy of the lower extremities",
        "nocturnal emission",
        "numbness of the lower extremities",
        "pain in the lower extremities" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """In the sacral region, in the second posterior sacral foramen.
 - Note: The second posterior sacral foramen is located in the depression, midway between the posterior superior iliac spine and the spinous process of the second sacral vertebra.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.8-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
