    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0002387 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "Superficially, the medial dorsal cutaneous nerve of foot derived from the superficial peroneal nerve; deeper, the deep peroneal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "facial paralysis",
