        "muscular atrophy of the foot",
        "pain of the upper teeth",
        "redness of the dorsum of the foot",
        "swelling of the dorsum of the foot" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the dorsum of the foot, at the joint of the base of the second metatarsal bone and the intermediate cuneiform bone, over the dorsalis pedis artery." ;
