        "redness of the eye",
        "swelling of the eye" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the head, in the depression at the medial end of the eyebrow.
 - Note: A depression, the frontal notch, can often be palpated on the medial end of the eyebrow directly superior to BL 1.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch, or prick with three-edged needle to cause bleeding." ;
