        "mastitis",
        "motor impairment of the lower extremities",
        "numbness of the knee",
        "pain in the knee" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the anterolateral aspect of the thigh, between the vastus lateralis muscle and the lateral border of the rectus femoris tendon, 2 B-cun superior to the base of the patella.
