        "Triple Energizer 20",
        "Triple Heater 20",
        "Triple Warmer 20" ;
    tara-ap:hasVasculatureInformation "The branches of the superficial temporal artery and vein. Innervation: The branches of the auriculotemporal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:isLocatedOnMeridian TARA:3898257 ;
