        "deviation of the mouth",
        "diplacusis",
        "headache",
        "tinnitus",
        "toothache" ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription """On the head, in the depression superior to the midpoint of the zygomatic arch.
 - Note: In the depression superior to the zygomatic arch, superior to ST 7.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 inch. Deep puncture is not advisable. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Shangguan" ;
