UBERON:0001445 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "skeleton of pes" ;
    IAO:0000115 "Subdivision of skeleton that is the collection of all skeletal elements in a pes, which is the distal section of the posterior hindlimb skeleton consisting of the mesopodium, the metapodium and the acropodium (e.g. including the ankle, sole, and toes)[Phenoscape]." ;
