    dcterms:description "A special, specific acupoint located on the Head and Trunk. Specific points refer to those of the fourteen meridians that have special properties and are grouped under special names. Specific Points on the Head and Trunk include: (1) Back-Shu Points, (2) Front-Mu Points, and (3) Crossing Points." ;
