 - Note: In males, ST 18 is located at the intersection of nipple line and the fifth intercostal space. In females, ST 18 is located at the midpoint of the inferior crease of the breast.""" ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
