RO:0002170 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "connected to",
        "connected to"@en ;
    IAO:0000112 "a 'toe distal phalanx bone' that is connected to a 'toe medial phalanx bone' (an interphalangeal joint *connects* these two bones)." ;
    IAO:0000115 "a is connected to b if and only if a and b are discrete structure, and there exists some connecting structure c, such that c connects a and b."@en ;
